<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - J.P. Morgan downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber downgraded J.P. Morgan &amp; Co Inc to neutral from attractive, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
